Error [jet.RecursiveLambda]: A lambda can't call itself as `f`
  --> tests/ui/lambda_self_recursive.jet:2:8
    |
  2 |     f: (x: Int) -> {
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Short functions stored in a binding can't recurse in v1
 Fix: Write a named `fn` instead of assigning the lambda to `f`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0804

Error [jet.UnknownName]: Nothing named `f` exists here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_self_recursive.jet:3:17
    |
  3 |         copy_f: f
    |                 ^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Did you mean `x`?
